        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>核心思想</strong></p>
            align: [center, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>主要局限</strong></p>
            align: [center, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>证据等级</strong></p>
            align: [center, middle]
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>Shelter</p>
            align: [center, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>用户态隔离，将 Realm 推进到 user-space</p>
            align: [left, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>生态依赖 runtime、OS 与 CCA 硬件支持</p>
            align: [left, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>E1</p>
            align: [center, middle]
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>RContainer</p>
            align: [center, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>安全容器，云原生部署</p>
            align: [left, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>编排系统耦合复杂</p>
