        - content:
            text: |
              <p>E1</p>
            align: [center, middle]
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>NanoZone</p>
            align: [center, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>细粒度内存保护域</p>
            align: [left, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>预印本，生态不成熟</p>
            align: [left, middle]
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>E3</p>
            align: [center, middle]
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        来源：三篇主讲材料选择、评价字段与 evidence ledger｜证据等级：方向综述
